  "id": "nuisance-variable",
  "term": "nuisance variable",
  "definition": "A nuisance variable is an extraneous factor that can influence measurements even though it is not the main variable being studied. When it is related to the variable of interest, it can introduce technical bias and increase the chance of false positive findings.",
